                    <h3>Menteve EEG Monitor v0.0.5 — LSL Streaming, ADC Scaling &amp; Sensitivity Bar</h3>

                    <p><strong>LSL Streaming:</strong></p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Discover, activate and record LSL streams with no headset attached</li>
                        <li>Streams refresh automatically; departed producers are deactivated and the plots rebuilt</li>
                        <li>Recordings containing PsychoPy markers are no longer discarded on save</li>
                    </ul>

                    <p><strong>Recording:</strong></p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>"Record Filtered Data" toggle to store raw, pre-filter samples</li>
                        <li>File extension now follows the selected format (EDF / XDF)</li>
                    </ul>

                    <p><strong>Amplitude &amp; Scaling:</strong></p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>New calibration bar (+X µV / 0 / −X µV) in the live monitor and the EDF viewer</li>
                        <li>Both windows now use one amplitude rule, so the same setting draws the same trace height</li>
                        <li>Sensitivity limited to 1–100 µV/mm; scales saved by older builds are clamped on load</li>
                        <li>Fixed µV/mm calibration and added top padding so the bar is not clipped</li>
                    </ul>

                    <p><strong>Bug Fixes:</strong></p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Corrected ADS1299 conversion — every voltage and impedance reading was 2× too high and is now half its previous value</li>
                        <li>Channel visibility survives stream and montage changes</li>
                    </ul>
                </body>
